{"sectionId":"organic_rxn/acyl","items":[{"id":"organic_rxn--acyl-k001","sectionId":"organic_rxn/acyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"carboxylic acid derivative는 친핵성 acyl substitution을 통해 서로 전환될 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--acyl-k002","sectionId":"organic_rxn/acyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"친핵체가 carbonyl에 첨가해 tetrahedral intermediate를 만들고 이탈기가 나가 carbonyl이 회복된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--acyl-k003","sectionId":"organic_rxn/acyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"전형적 반응성은 acyl chloride > anhydride > ester > amide이며 carboxylate는 일반적으로 매우 낮다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--acyl-k004","sectionId":"organic_rxn/acyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"조건과 기질에 따라 예외가 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--acyl-k005","sectionId":"organic_rxn/acyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"acid chloride는 물과 acid, alcohol과 ester, amine과 amide를 형성할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--acyl-k006","sectionId":"organic_rxn/acyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"Fischer esterification은 acid와 alcohol의 산촉매 가역 반응이며 물 제거가 ester 방향에 유리하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--acyl-k007","sectionId":"organic_rxn/acyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"산촉매 ester 가수분해는 가역적이고 염기성 비누화는 carboxylate 생성으로 정반응이 유리해진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--acyl-k008","sectionId":"organic_rxn/acyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"ester의 LiAlH₄ 환원은 alcohol들을 생성하며 Grignard는 보통 두 번 첨가해 3차 alcohol을 준다(formate 등 예외).","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--acyl-k009","sectionId":"organic_rxn/acyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"amide는 공명 때문에 C–N 결합이 부분 이중결합 성격을 가지며 강한 산·염기 및 가열 조건에서 가수분해될 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--acyl-k010","sectionId":"organic_rxn/acyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"nitrile의 가수분해는 acid/ carboxylate, 환원은 1차 amine으로 이어질 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--acyl-k011","sectionId":"organic_rxn/acyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"acyl substitution은 첨가 후 제거로 carbonyl 회복.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--acyl-k012","sectionId":"organic_rxn/acyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"amide는 공명 안정화로 반응성이 낮다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--acyl-k013","sectionId":"organic_rxn/acyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"비누화는 염기성 ester 가수분해.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--acyl-k014","sectionId":"organic_rxn/acyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"carboxylic acid의 산성 proton은 Grignard와 먼저 산염기 반응한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--acyl-k015","sectionId":"organic_rxn/acyl","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"Acetate와 ethanol이 생성된다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]}]}